   "text": "CESI School of Engineering - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nCESI School of Engineering\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nCESI gives each engineering student the opportunity to build a tailor-made career path. With 25 campuses around France, CESI supports engineering students through a customizable five-year education leading to the Master’s-level Engineering Degree accredited by the French state.\nEngineers must be multi-talented, possess both scientific and technical knowledge, and have a good understanding of the mechanisms of management and administration. CESI offers  a multi-cultural environment where French and international students are trained to leave a positive impact on our globalized world.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n31/07/2026 12:36\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n10/04/2026 06:23\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nFrance\nYearly Fees\nMax: €10,500.00\nMin: €6,500.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n25%\n250 of 1,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1958\nCampus(es)\nToulouse, La Rochelle\nCountry\nFrance\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n02/04/2026\nContract End Date\n31/03/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.cesi.fr/en/international/support-funding/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/groupecesi1\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
